archive/

# Audio captures (large, ephemeral)
recordings/

# Derived phenological corpus (~4.5 GB, rebuildable from the AudioMoth
# originals with tools/build_corpus.py). The manifest is small and is the
# thing the engine actually reads, so it is tracked.
corpus/*
!corpus/manifest.json
# The camera-trap register (tools/build_cameratrap.py). Tracked, unlike the
# visual tier below, because its source is 22 MOV files on a Desktop that has
# never been in this repo — so this 18 KB file is the only record here that
# the captures exist, what was in them and where they fall on the ring.
!corpus/cameratrap.json
# corpus/visual/ (~115 MB of derived h264 + index.json) stays out entirely:
# rebuildable with tools/build_visual.py, and the index is meaningless without
# the video beside it. Slot C prints the build command when it finds neither.

# Session autosave state — machine-local, not a shareable preset
presets/_autosave.json
